    "progress": [
      {
        "date": "2026-11-16",
        "text": "Corrected six atomic nodes: filter kernels and Float32 arithmetic, rectangular scaling, independent tiling, channel selection and save/load, and empty Text/SVG backgrounds. Behavior and validation"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-11-15",
        "text": "Corrected node defaults, typed unconnected inputs, missing-texture output and SBS serialization; updated catalog counts and remaining validation scope"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-11-08",
        "text": "Explorer folder hierarchy and package/folder/graph context menus, native SBS empty folders and resource paths, undoable copy/move/rename/remove, and package reload/save-copy actions"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-11-08",
        "text": "Portable sbs:// function instances in the Library, preserved package folders and missing references, and a converted library retaining all 171 supplied function bodies (2,334 nodes); external runtime equivalence and redistribution rights remain unverified"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-11-02",
        "text": "Cross-app materials: .mcmat portable materials, Send to TextureCraft, input-node preview images (mesh maps from TextureCraft), live re-cooks from TextureCraft through the CLI"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-11-02",
        "text": "Visual function editor, dynamic parameters, presets and groups, 105 more nodes (flood fill, FX-Map, SVG, Text, 3D noises, weathering, material blending), mesh import, browser file I/O, 2D histogram, CLI --set, better samples"
      },
      {
        "date": "2026-11-02",
        "text": "First day: engine, ~120 nodes, cooking cache, packages, export, the full editor UI, 3D preview, CLI, control channel with synthetic input, MCP server, wasm builds"
      }
    ]
  },
